---
title: Ertib potato sandwich
tags: [ethiopian, vegan]
cuisine: ethiopian
source: Ertib Potato Sandwich by StarChefs, https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/ertib-potato-sandwich
---

== Chickpea salad ==

Toss the @chickpeas{1%cup} with the @onion{1}(diced), @tomatoes{1}(diced) and
@jalapeños{1}(diced).

Season with @garlic{}(minced), @adobo seasoning{} and @sazon seasoning{}, then
dress with the house vinaigrette (basics/house-vinaigrette) and @extra virgin olive oil{}.
Refrigerate.

== Potato filling ==

Heat the @neutral oil{2%tbsp} in a #sauté pan{} over medium heat. Cook the
@onion{7}(julienned) until soft and translucent.

Add the @crushed tomatoes{100%g} and cook ~{1%minute}. Add the
@garlic{1/2}(minced), season with @adobo seasoning{} and @sazon seasoning{},
and cook ~{2%minutes} more.

Add the @potatoes{1/2}(blanched, sliced) and cook ~{2%minutes}. Stir in the
@tomato{3}(julienned) and @jalapeño{3}(julienned) and take the pan off the
heat.

== Sandwich ==

Pile the potato filling onto the bottom half of the
@bread{}(sandwich loaf, toasted, split). Close it, cut in half, and serve with the chickpea salad.
